    "name": "multi-barcode-hd",
    "video": "hd/multi-barcode.y4m",
    "query": "?mode=multi",
    "expect": {
      "type": "barcodes",
      "exact": true,
      "codes": [
        "qrcode|https://example.test/id-scan-spike/qr?n=42",
        "qrcode|SECOND QR: 900314123408",
        "pdf417|PDF417 MULTI SHEET|ALPHA|BRAVO|1234567890",
        "datamatrix|DM-SPIKE-2026-10-14",
        "ean13|6001234567899",
        "code39|SPIKE-39"
      ],
      "optional": [
        "code128|DOCSCAN-TEST-0001",
        "code128|CARD-128-B"
      ]
    },
    "note": "The scan finishes by itself 2.5 s after the last new code (MultiBarcode.tsx, QUIET_MS). The clip holds the sheet still for only 2.2 s before looping. The six other codes confirm within that hold every time; the two small Code 128s confirm in it only some of the time (otherwise on a later loop, 4-14 s after the others, which the old wait-for-everything test relied on), so they are optional. Finishing early also ends the scan before the rare single-loop misreads (an EAN-8 or UPC-E inside a dense symbol) that used to appear 15-18 s in."
  },
